// Global, conditional (crates/velt_loader/src/globals): the exponential functions of `Math`, `exp`
// and `expm1` (velt/lang/math/exp_functions), for a program that calls one; other programs don't
// load the ports behind them, and a program that calls one loads no other group's.
// load when std/prelude/math uses: .exp .expm1
import "velt/lang/math/exp_functions";
